graph TD
    A[Admin faz upload de token] --> B[Server processa imagem + watermark]
    B --> C[Salva em public/images/tokens/slug/]
    C --> D[Atualiza collections.json]
    D --> E[gitPersist chamado]
    E --> F{git add + commit ok?}
    F -->|sim| G[pushWithRetry attempt 1]
    F -->|nada staged| Z1[LOG: SKIP, state=clean]

    G --> H{Push ok?}
    H -->|sim| I[LOG: PUSH OK, state=clean]
    H -->|erro transitorio| J{Tentativas < 3?}
    J -->|sim| K[LOG: RETRY in Nms]
    K --> L[sleep + fetch + rebase]
    L --> M[pushWithRetry attempt N+1]
    M --> H

    J -->|nao| N[LOG: PUSH FAILED, state=error]
    N --> O[recentOps registra falha]
    O --> P[Banner vermelho no admin]
    P --> Q{Admin clica Retry?}
    Q -->|sim| E
    Q -->|nao| R[Dados perdidos no proximo redeploy]

    H -->|erro auth/config| S[LOG: PUSH FAILED permanent]
    S --> O

    I --> T[recentOps registra sucesso]
    T --> U[Banner verde no admin]
    U --> V[Redeploy seguro - dados no GitHub]

    style N fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style I fill:#51cf66,stroke:#333,color:#000
    style K fill:#f9e44c,stroke:#333,color:#000
    style R fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#333,color:#fff
